ves International, Inc. under U.S. Patents 5,965,596; 6,172,098; and 6,426,361"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Each serving supplies 200 mg of caffeine."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"WARNING: For adult use only."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Capsimax(TM)"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Capsimax(TM) trademark belongs to OmniActive Health Technologies."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"CarnoSyn(TM)\nCarnosine Synthesizer"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"resVida(R)\npromotes healthy aging"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"ResVida(R) is a trademark of DSM."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"FUEL MIND-BLOWING, HARDCORE TRAINING TO DRIVE ULTRA-RIPPED MUSCULARITY & MENTAL INTENSITY\n~POWERFUL THERMOGENIC AGENTS TRIGGER DRAMATIC PRE-TRAINING CALORIC BURN*\n~POTENT THERMOGENIC FORMULA FOR RAPID RUSH AND FATTY ACID METABOLISM*\n~FUELS EXTREME PHYSIQUE REPARTITIONING WORKOUTS AND PROMOTES ANABOLIC DRIVE*\n~HARDCORE METABOLIC STACK PROVIDES BLISTERING INTENSITY AND IGNITES METABOLISM*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The intense, focused training you demand to reach your peak potential places incredible stresses on your body. To transform your physique and perform at the highest level possible, you need to supply your body with a dynamic spectrum of nutrients and metabolic co-factors that enhance performance, promote fatty acid metabolism and support recovery.* Beyond RAW(TM) Refine is designed specifically to provide the fuel you need to ignite your metabolism.* This revolutionary formula is loaded with a precise array of elements that dramatically transforms your body into a dynamic calorie burning machine.*"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Use only as directed. Do not exceed recommended daily intake."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Magnify Muscle Energy. Crush Free Radicals. Intensify Mental Focus and Drive."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"LIMITED EDITION"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"REFINE"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, take three capsules 30 to 60 minutes before exercise once per day."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 826317 BMG"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN"},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 10253 1","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}